<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3691/96  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7965/75  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.0225/35  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4770/80  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     37.11/12   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.0665/95  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1744.0/6.0 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     113.94/99  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.8029/79  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.5007/27  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.8481/01  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6874/79</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$319.70/20</p>
</text>
